    "created_at": "2018-02-20T19:55:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-20T19:55:01Z",
    "body": "...the description of `pixelated` seems to be **exactly opposite** what it should be. `pixelated` does *not* \"maximize the appearance of the image\", and color-smoothing is 100% antithetical to the meaning of the keyword.\r\n\r\nWe should blame this and see where it came from, because it seems like a simple mistake.",
