    "body": "Given #3424 never landed, and this is still in the spec, I'm going to fix it. There is a complicating factor, however. When the screen pixel size is not 1-1, as with non-square pixels or non-integral zoom, pixelated can produce very [nasty results](https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40210325#comment18). I still think the spec should be updated as it is the desired behavior.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
